title: "ER2-ENGINE: a Quarto execution engine and syntax highlighter for ER2"
abstract: >-
  A Quarto engine extension that executes ER2 code blocks, keeping one ER2
  session per document, together with ER2's syntax definition, which Quarto
  applies automatically.
